{{ $('Collect Official Feeds').first().json._prompt }}

Standing rules that never change: CHECK the earnings list before scoring anything. Insider filing COUNTS without transaction codes are attention flags at most. GEX regime is timing context, never a thesis. Most nights produce ZERO opportunities >=65 — an empty list is the honest default. Every opportunity needs an OBSERVABLE invalidation condition. This is research for human review — never instructions to trade.

